    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Buy and sell weapons</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase a variety of weapons from the blacksmith and furniture from the carpenter to display them. Sell your goods to adventurers eager to embark on epic quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Upgrade and customize your shop</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop by purchasing upgrades, giving you more space for furniture and adding a backroom to store excess inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unlock new equipment</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience with every sale to increase your reputation level and gain points to spend in a skill tree, unlocking new weapons and items to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize your clientele</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a shop for warriors only? Go for it. Prefer rangers? Sure! How about warriors and mages, but no rangers? You can do that too! With our satisfaction system, the more items you sell to a specific class, the more likely you\u2019ll attract similar customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your feedback matters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encountered a bug? Got an idea to improve the game? Something not to your liking? Join our Discord or leave a comment on Steam to share your thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note: while we can\u2019t implement every idea, we\u2019ll read all feedback and take every message into consideration.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Buy and sell weapons</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase a variety of weapons from the blacksmith and furniture from the carpenter to display them. Sell your goods to adventurers eager to embark on epic quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Upgrade and customize your shop</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your shop by purchasing upgrades, giving you more space for furniture and adding a backroom to store excess inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Unlock new equipment</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn experience with every sale to increase your reputation level and gain points to spend in a skill tree, unlocking new weapons and items to sell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Customize your clientele</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a shop for warriors only? Go for it. Prefer rangers? Sure! How about warriors and mages, but no rangers? You can do that too! With our satisfaction system, the more items you sell to a specific class, the more likely you\u2019ll attract similar customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Your feedback matters</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encountered a bug? Got an idea to improve the game? Something not to your liking? Join our Discord or leave a comment on Steam to share your thoughts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note: while we can\u2019t implement every idea, we\u2019ll read all feedback and take every message into consideration.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into a medieval fantasy world as a shopkeeper providing tools for brave adventurers embarking on their quests. Buy and sell weapons, upgrade and customize your shop, optimize your space, unlock new gear, and more. After all, behind every hero stands a master shopkeeper.",
